WEBVTT

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:39.610
This year, there's an abundant harvest of corn at Grandpa's farm too.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.710
I came here today with my friend.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.630
Let's pick a lot of them to bring home, kid!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:55.970
A Flower Bud's Feelings

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:02.130
Pick ones with long silks, okay?

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:17.670
What's that?

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:46.260
I told her so many times not to steal!

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:47.450
Hey, kid!

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.250
Hey, wait!

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.140
Hey, kid!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:30.080
You say something to her too! You're the same species!

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.490
Hey, kid!

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:06.820
What's with that happy face of yours, huh? Huh? Huh!?

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.870
Hey! Leave the corn behind!

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.970
Did you forget Kyo's words already!?

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.480
Seems like you're not hurt. Your hip was just stuck?

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.620
That's not it! That's probably not it! Think it over again!

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:32.980
Hey! Today's strawberry filling! There's no need to thank me!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:39.420
That's wrong! Your stomachs growling! Do you really...!

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:40.930
One more time!

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.530
They look really good.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.030
I'm sure there are a lot of people who want to eat chestnuts.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:02.260
A common harmless snake.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.640
I guess she can be understanding too.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:19.830
Was she planning to give corn to Kyo?

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.670
Yeah, Kyo.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.820
Hey, wait!

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.390
Don't come here! Stop!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.860
Stop! Don't come any closer!

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.320
Do something about this, Guchuko!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:14.560
Here. This is Kyo's, your's and everyone's share.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.770
You can take these.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.660
Go on. Take them.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.920
Tell Kyo I said "hi" and...

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.910
...put this in your pants while you're at it.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.110
Take it! Take it with you!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.240
In the end, Guchuko took the snake with her.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.260
Ah, I was so surprised.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.680
She's a violent girl but quite interesting.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.710
The flower bud on her head was big too.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.890
I wonder what kind of flower is going to bloom?

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:08.300
Yo.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.630
That was quick, Sunao.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.320
Yeah, I was able to switch trains quickly.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.180
That's a fine corn on the cob.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.490
Suna-o! Suna-o!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.140
It's quite heavy. Thanks a lot.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:37.280
Are you sure we can have this many?

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.350
Yeah, grandpa said you can take as many as you want.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.260
The kid picked those herself.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.340
I see. That's amazing.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:49.710
Good job.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:51.960
How about we eat them tonight?

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.700
It's about time we go home, Potemayo.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.240
Later. Thanks a lot for today.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.000
Take care, kid!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.180
What was that?

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.000
That flower bud got bigger in an instant.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:22.530
It's like the flower is delighted together with her.

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:35.550
Guchuko!

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.570
Thanks for the corn!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.610
It's really good!

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:51.870
Oh yeah! There are smiles like flowers too, right?

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.850
When people are happy, flowers will bloom.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:03.560
That's right. When they eat our corn, Subaru and everyone else's flower will bloom in delight.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:13.500
I know! I should give some to Yasumi and the others too! Then...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.940
A flower like smile.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.380
Hey! Don't throw up during the meal!

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.360
Yasumi! Yasumi!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:39.470
What is it, kid?

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.610
I went to my grandpa's place today.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:42.530
And?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.300
Here's a souvenir!

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:52.640
What do you think? They're good you know! And really sweet!

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:07.150
TL: Corn - 500 yen

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.520
What are you doing!?

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:07.050
I'm just joking with you.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.410
Suna-o. Suna-o.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.020
I know, I know.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.020
We were talking about my trip to Mexico, right?

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.350
By the way, are my stories helpful to you?

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:29.100
I see.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:35.300
Well, when we got to dad's work site, there was a small village.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:41.220
Potemayo's
Don't eat it!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:40.810
Then during lunch, mom tried to warm up some milk but...

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:50.220
Delicious! Where'd you get these?

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.350
Who knows.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.690
What? You can tell me.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:17.850
Extra

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:20.990
This looks good.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:26.110
The size of the kernel and its radiance...it must have a high sugar content.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:30.650
But here we have some chocolate popcorn.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:34.120
The lightness of it in your mouth and the sweetness is irresistible.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:37.320
But if you're too lax in the summer, it clumps together!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.180
So, are you going to buy it or not?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.780
Yeah. Corn could also be classified as sweets.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:44.680
I'll take them.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:04.510
When I was a kid, I traveled with my parents.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:10.700
I know it was for dad's job, but what kind of job it was...

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.400
...I still don't know exactly what it is to this day.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.350
Hey, Sunao.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.600
I'm sure dad's going to be surprised.

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:35.720
He'll be surprised once he finds out that you made all of this lunch today.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:46.060
About Mom

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.880
Hey, where's dad?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:54.260
Let's see...

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:55.950
Look! He's over there!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:59.900
He's on that big rock over there.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.060
He just fell.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.540
He fell?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.290
Yeah, he fell.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.710
I'm really glad it wasn't serious!

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.820
You should take in nutrients and get better quickly.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.450
Wait a little while. I'm heating up some milk right now.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.500
Hey, the pot!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.870
Leave it to me!

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.250
That scalding was the most serious injury.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:53.920
And so, being clumsy around milk has become a Moriyama tradition to be passed on.

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.220
That was hot...

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.980
That made it unnecessarily hotter.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:22.000
It was mom's birthday the other day.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:29.730
Even so...

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:39.140
"Silence!", the king had returned.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:42.350
"Anyone can say things like that easily."

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.970
"I have never cut open a person's bowels."

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:50.970
"I won't listen to your wailing while you're holding on to your stomach like that."

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.520
Ah, the king was clever.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.110
"I can be conceited because I am prepared to die."

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.120
"I would never beg for my life."

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:07.750
Let's go home.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.040
Sunao!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.280
You're on duty today, right?

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:15.240
Mutan! I'll help you, Mutan.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.120
You're not on duty.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.430
Sunao!

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:21.540
Potemayo.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.420
Hey, Mikan!

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:33.510
If you don't hurry up we'll leave you!

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.290
What were you spacing out at?

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:39.820
She was probably looking at Moriyama.

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.590
That's not it.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.230
Let's leave it at that then.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:47.770
It's completely obvious though.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.980
I told you it's not that.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.250
Moriyama-kun's dad?

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.670
Hey! It's been a while.

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:01.700
Did you travel somewhere again?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:02.730
Yep.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.990
Is Sunao not going home yet?

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.520
I think he'll be coming soon.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:09.190
I see.

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:11.680
What's that, mister?

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:13.550
This?

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:16.470
It's pretty!

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:20.200
Isn't it? It's for his dead mom's birthday present.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:24.770
It passed a while ago though.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.850
It took me a week to get my hands on it.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.650
That's amazing.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:34.760
Yeah! You can't find a splendid penis case like this anywhere!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.550
What's Mikan doing?

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:43.680
Who knows?

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.880
Thanks for letting me see something so precious.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.140
No problem.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:00.360
Hey, Moriyama-kun.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.750
You don't want to meet your dad?

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:04.850
Suna-o.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.740
Hey, Sunao!

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:08.510
It's been a while.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.960
Hey, mochi-mochi! Have you been doing well?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.410
I see. You're doing well.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:17.740
I said I'm sorry, Sunao-kun.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.580
I'm not the one you should be apologizing to.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.710
How about you at least come back for mom's birthday.

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:24.960
I'm really sorry.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:25.680
Don't touch me.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.630
Don't be so mad, Sunao.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.400
Moriyama-kun, your dad...!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:44.520
Wait!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:48.870
Apologize to your dad!

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.820
You don't even listen and you suddenly raise your hand at him!

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.030
That's not good!

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:19.670
I'm sorry!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:20.620
Mikan!

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:21.520
Mikan!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.290
Mikan!

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:51.670
I'm sorry.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:56.640
I'm sorry.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.240
Sunao?

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.530
What time is it now?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:20.480
8 o'clock.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.290
I'm a bit tired.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.950
Could you heat me up some milk?

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:34.750
Oh yeah! I forgot, I forgot!

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:48.500
That girl was named Mikan, right?

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:50.330
She's a good girl.

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:56.150
She yelled at you like that because she cherishes  you.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.390
How about you take her as a bride already?

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:05.810
Hey, hey! Why are you suddenly turning off the lights?

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.120
You must be blushing.

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.230
Today's kind of hot.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.700
You're quite serious, mochi-mochi.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.620
Good girl.

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:34.080
What's that on your head though?

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:36.770
Mom will be really happy when it blooms.

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:39.530
But...

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:45.300
It'll bloom, scatter and then...

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.840
...what'll happen to her?

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:50.750
Hey, hey.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.220
What should I do?

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.750
I lost my cool and got angry.

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:04.850
I don't know how I should face him tomorrow.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:12.210
He was angry like that because he loved his dad and mom.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.190
But I...

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:28.210
Why doesn't she yell at me!?

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:31.320
How about you decide whether you're going to eat, be angry or go to the toilet!?

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:37.240
If it's bedtime stories, leave it to papa!

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:42.930
Well then, for tonight, let's talk about how Naumann elephants copula---

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:46.750
You don't even listen and you suddenly raise your hand at him!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.130
I'm sorry.

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:54.440
I have a big nosebleed now though.

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:26.920
Hey, Sunao.

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:31.520
I think I like Japan the most after all.

00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:35.290
Many different kinds of flowers bloom and scatter.

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:40.010
Flowers

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:38.090
Next: The last episode.

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:39.080
Flowers
